  "body": "> **Stacked on #227** (#191's gate routes). A fork branch cannot be a PR base here, so this targets `main` and also carries #227's commit `7315c79`; **review only the last commit, `69017d5`**. Once #227 merges, this diff shrinks to that commit.\n\n## What changed\n\nReported in #216: with a model and a tool but no stock, every Create cell could be clicked and then refused \"no stock; set up stock first\" on a hard-to-read status line.\n\nEvery ribbon-made operation machines the active setup's stock (`SrcRef::Stock`), so in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes.rs`:\n\n- `has_stock` - the command door's own resolution (`setup::stock_entity_name` + `model::is_stock`);\n- `enabled(Cmd::Create)` also needs it - the cell darkens;\n- the tip reads \"No stock yet - set up stock first (Setup > Stock)\";\n- a click anyway names it on the status line and opens the **Stock page** (`GateRoute::Stock`, #191's route).\n\nGate order: no tool → wrong machine family → no stock → tool law (stock cannot fix a family mismatch, so that is said first). Decision recorded in `RECOMMENDED.md` (#216).\n\n## Gate (own worktree build)\n\n`cargo test -p camcraft-ui`: every binary green except the lib's `egui_shell_snapshot_light` (Diff 1) and `tool_editor_snapshot` (Diff 4) - software-GL diffs with the same counts on main on this machine; no existing UI test broke. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Pinning test\n\n`egui_app::gate_route_tests::no_stock_darkens_the_cell_and_routes_to_the_stock_page` - with a tool and no stock the Face cell is dark, its tip says \"set up stock first\", a click opens the Stock page; setting stock lights it again.\n\nChangelog: Create cells darken with no stock in the setup, and a click opens the Stock page\n\nOutside contributor PR (fork) - feat, merges at the next cut, after #227.\n\nFixes #216\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
